1
00:01:47,160 --> 00:01:51,520
I told you, no! I'm not for sale!

2
00:01:52,324 --> 00:01:58,380
He is my beloved grandchild. Um, if you want a puppet, please take this wood-carved one.

3
00:01:58,779 --> 00:02:01,920
Ah, what I want is that talking wooden puppet.

4
00:02:02,040 --> 00:02:03,500
Please, sell it to me.

5
00:02:04,189 --> 00:02:09,539
How many times do I have to tell you?! I'm not for sale! / 500 lire. How about 500 lire?

6
00:02:09,875 --> 00:02:11,360
I'll give you 1,000 lire!

7
00:02:11,755 --> 00:02:12,460
2,000 lire!

8
00:02:12,589 --> 00:02:13,420
3,000 lire!

9
00:02:13,580 --> 00:02:14,260
5,000 lire!

10
00:02:14,420 --> 00:02:15,060
7,000 lire!

11
00:02:15,285 --> 00:02:16,900
8,000 lire! No, 10,000 lire!

12
00:02:17,054 --> 00:02:19,100
All right, I'll pay 15,000 lire!

13
00:02:19,200 --> 00:02:22,260
That's more than you could earn in a lifetime!

14
00:02:22,939 --> 00:02:25,240
He's not for sale! He is not for sale!

15
00:02:26,020 --> 00:02:27,020
Back!

16
00:02:31,010 --> 00:02:33,220
Stupid puppet seller!

17
00:02:35,514 --> 00:02:36,514
Back!

18
00:02:44,780 --> 00:02:47,620
That's why I said I didn't want to come to a town like this!

19
00:02:50,530 --> 00:02:51,620
Hey, watch out!

20
00:02:51,920 --> 00:02:53,540
You look like a puppet, yet you're so violent!

21
00:02:55,080 --> 00:02:57,160
I'm not a puppet!

22
00:02:57,420 --> 00:02:58,420
Ugh!

23
00:02:58,454 --> 00:03:00,200
I want to be alone!

24
00:03:00,510 --> 00:03:01,510
Go away!

25
00:03:01,780 --> 00:03:03,000
Hurry up and get lost!

26
00:03:03,780 --> 00:03:05,540
Humans really are nasty. Let's go!

27
00:03:06,369 --> 00:03:07,700
Get out of here!

28
00:03:08,520 --> 00:03:09,520
Mokku!

29
00:03:12,680 --> 00:03:14,320
Grandpa, let's go back to the village.

30
00:03:18,040 --> 00:03:19,800
This is part of your learning, too.

31
00:03:20,400 --> 00:03:22,700
Come along now. I'll buy you something nice.

32
00:03:30,700 --> 00:03:31,700
(coins clinking)

33
00:03:35,430 --> 00:03:39,940
How's that, Mokku? From any angle, you look just like a fine human, don't you?

34
00:03:40,640 --> 00:03:41,640
(laughter)

35
00:03:42,885 --> 00:03:47,260
But if you spend this much money, won't we not be able to stay at an inn?

36
00:03:48,160 --> 00:03:48,560
(laughter)

37
00:03:48,790 --> 00:03:51,460
The sun is still high. The puppets will sell.

38
00:03:51,660 --> 00:03:54,960
Thanks, Grandpa! I'm going out for a bit.

39
00:03:55,619 --> 00:03:59,840
Hey, hey, hold on! Where are you going? You'll fall if you run like that!

40
00:04:01,500 --> 00:04:07,740
Little girl! Girl from earlier! Aren't you here? Little girl!

41
00:04:08,790 --> 00:04:11,140
Oh, that mean puppet is back.

42
00:04:11,280 --> 00:04:12,300
We have to be careful.

43
00:04:13,640 --> 00:04:16,880
Hey, sorry about earlier. I was just worked up.

44
00:04:17,145 --> 00:04:20,399
Huh, you came to apologize? That's a surprise.

45
00:04:21,910 --> 00:04:24,880
And also, I wanted you to see how I look now.

46
00:04:25,605 --> 00:04:26,880
Do I look human?

47
00:04:27,440 --> 00:04:30,320
Yeah, as long as you don't say anything, you definitely look human.

48
00:04:30,660 --> 00:04:32,580
You don't look like a puppet at all.

49
00:04:33,275 --> 00:04:37,500
Thanks! Hearing that from you gives me real confidence.

50
00:04:37,980 --> 00:04:40,140
Can you talk to butterflies?

51
00:04:56,180 --> 00:05:00,680
So pretty...

52
00:05:00,880 --> 00:05:02,600
Hey, what's wrong?

53
00:05:04,300 --> 00:05:09,860
N-N-No, uh, I was j-just talking to myself. S-Sorry.

54
00:05:10,419 --> 00:05:12,320
Oh, you don't have to apologize.

55
00:05:18,610 --> 00:05:20,380
Talking to butterflies...

56
00:05:22,050 --> 00:05:24,300
That's simply impossible, isn't it?

57
00:05:24,610 --> 00:05:27,520
Y-Yes, exactly. It's impossible.

58
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:36,440
I'm Mellerie. What's your name?

59
00:05:37,045 --> 00:05:41,900
Oh, yes. I-I'm a pup... ugh... I'm Mokku the human.

60
00:05:42,410 --> 00:05:44,800
My, "Mokku the human"?

61
00:05:48,700 --> 00:05:49,220
(Mother's voice)

62
00:05:49,221 --> 00:05:50,320
(Girl) Please, help me!

63
00:05:51,000 --> 00:05:52,000
(Girl) Huh?

64
00:05:52,720 --> 00:05:53,720
(Girl) She's a witch!

65
00:05:54,700 --> 00:05:55,700
(Girl) Hurry!

66
00:05:56,820 --> 00:05:57,860
(Girl) A witch!?

67
00:05:58,160 --> 00:05:59,160
(Girl) All right!

68
00:06:02,370 --> 00:06:03,680
(Girl) You mustn't go with him!

69
00:06:10,950 --> 00:06:13,200
(Girl) Young mistress! Lady Mellerie!

70
00:06:14,320 --> 00:06:16,540
How strange...

71
00:06:17,770 --> 00:06:18,780
You're safe now.

72
00:06:19,175 --> 00:06:20,280
Thank you, Mokku.

73
00:06:26,415 --> 00:06:28,740
Yvonne is actually my tutor.

74
00:06:30,100 --> 00:06:31,120
A tutor?

75
00:06:31,540 --> 00:06:34,060
Oh, you don't know what a tutor is, Mokku?

76
00:06:34,490 --> 00:06:37,280
It's someone who teaches you lessons at home.

77
00:06:37,605 --> 00:06:38,605
Don't you have one?

78
00:06:39,355 --> 00:06:41,020
My tutor is Grandpa.

79
00:06:41,470 --> 00:06:45,360
He brought me along, saying it's important to see the world and learn.

80
00:06:45,675 --> 00:06:46,675
Is he nice?

81
00:06:47,820 --> 00:06:49,500
He's really kind.

82
00:06:50,900 --> 00:06:56,380
Yvonne is very strict. She never lets me go outside alone.

83
00:06:57,205 --> 00:06:59,100
Poor Mellerie.

84
00:07:00,320 --> 00:07:01,820
Yes, terribly so.

85
00:07:03,060 --> 00:07:06,240
All right, I'll beat up that awful person for you!

86
00:07:07,610 --> 00:07:08,860
You're so sweet.

87
00:07:10,015 --> 00:07:12,320
Not really...

88
00:07:18,960 --> 00:07:19,960
Grandpa!

89
00:07:21,380 --> 00:07:24,780
Ah, Mokku. Where on earth have you been?

90
00:07:26,890 --> 00:07:28,880
This is my girlfriend, Mellerie.

91
00:07:32,880 --> 00:07:34,960
I'm Mellerie Luca. Nice to meet you.

92
00:07:35,990 --> 00:07:39,800
What? Then are you the daughter of that famous millionaire?

93
00:07:39,825 --> 00:07:40,825
Yes, I am.

94
00:07:40,955 --> 00:07:43,700
Whoa, your family is that rich?

95
00:07:44,610 --> 00:07:48,960
Papa just owns lots of banks and shipping companies. That's all.

96
00:07:49,105 --> 00:07:52,300
Hmm, I don't really like rich people.

97
00:07:52,675 --> 00:07:55,720
Me neither. I envy you.

98
00:08:10,380 --> 00:08:11,380
[[NO AUDIO]]

99
00:08:17,490 --> 00:08:19,340
Come now, Mellerie, what is the matter?

100
00:08:20,100 --> 00:08:23,240
It's boring always being with you, Yvonne.

101
00:08:24,080 --> 00:08:28,260
To enter high society, you need proper discipline and refinement.

102
00:08:28,885 --> 00:08:30,300
I don't care about high society!

103
00:08:31,155 --> 00:08:33,980
I just want to run along the beach with Mokku,

104
00:08:34,320 --> 00:08:39,821
walk through the town, and chase butterflies in the flower fields... Mellerie?

105
00:08:40,480 --> 00:08:45,180
Goodness, what are you saying? In just one day, how did you become such a bad girl, Mellerie?

106
00:08:45,280 --> 00:08:46,940
Now, Mama, wait.

107
00:08:48,620 --> 00:08:54,700
This is the first time I've ever seen Mellerie look so serious, yet so bright and full of life.

108
00:08:55,240 --> 00:08:58,760
But... please, Papa, it's all right for Mokku to come to our house, isn't it?

109
00:08:59,575 --> 00:09:09,700
But, Mellerie, as for that... Um, even I can attend that high-and-mighty society thing if I just study properly!

110
00:09:36,600 --> 00:09:44,600
(Children laughing)

111
00:10:08,369 --> 00:10:09,440
(Laughter)

112
00:10:18,595 --> 00:10:19,595
(Screaming)

113
00:10:29,459 --> 00:10:33,280
That was close... That startled me.

114
00:10:35,499 --> 00:10:36,740
Thank you, Mokku.

115
00:10:44,279 --> 00:10:56,280
You're surprisingly a coward, Mokku. After saying you'd beat up Papa, Mama, and Yvonne! Well, I had no idea Mellerie's house would be so big and grand!

116
00:10:57,159 --> 00:10:58,880
Oh, there's a starling's nest!

117
00:11:01,379 --> 00:11:02,800
I'll get it for you.

118
00:11:02,900 --> 00:11:03,900
Look!

119
00:11:05,985 --> 00:11:08,100
Wait, Mokku!

120
00:11:11,179 --> 00:11:13,520
Mokku, that's dangerous! Be careful!

121
00:11:13,905 --> 00:11:14,905
It's all right, it's all right!

122
00:11:22,179 --> 00:11:23,179
Is there anything inside?

123
00:11:23,940 --> 00:11:25,200
There are eggs!

124
00:11:25,525 --> 00:11:26,640
Show me, too!

125
00:11:27,320 --> 00:11:27,680
All right!

126
00:11:28,205 --> 00:11:29,700
Mokku!

127
00:11:30,159 --> 00:11:31,260
You're not being honest.

128
00:11:32,639 --> 00:11:35,540
Huh? What are you doing all the way out here?

129
00:11:35,675 --> 00:11:39,140
You're hiding the fact that you're a wooden puppet from that girl.

130
00:11:39,729 --> 00:11:41,680
I'm not hiding anything!

131
00:11:42,459 --> 00:11:45,120
Then why don't you just tell her you're a wooden puppet?

132
00:11:45,699 --> 00:11:47,000
Mind your own business!

133
00:11:47,849 --> 00:11:50,740
You're hiding it because you fell for Mellerie.

134
00:11:50,939 --> 00:11:52,560
You're a coward, Mokku.

135
00:11:53,220 --> 00:11:54,220
Shut up!

136
00:11:54,395 --> 00:11:56,240
Hey, wait, Mokku!

137
00:11:59,939 --> 00:12:00,939
Mokku!

138
00:12:02,874 --> 00:12:04,240
Mokku! Are you all right?

139
00:12:05,089 --> 00:12:06,340
I'm totally fine!

140
00:12:08,670 --> 00:12:11,040
Thank goodness. Are you really all right?

141
00:12:15,279 --> 00:12:17,740
Your body is so hard, Mokku.

142
00:12:18,400 --> 00:12:19,400
Huh?

143
00:12:23,430 --> 00:12:25,700
That's because I've trained my body.

144
00:12:26,729 --> 00:12:31,140
It felt as solid as an oak tree...

145
00:12:46,169 --> 00:12:52,580
Thank you all for gathering here today for Mellerie's birthday.

146
00:12:55,069 --> 00:12:56,069
Grandpa!

147
00:13:02,215 --> 00:13:03,920
Ah, welcome.

148
00:13:04,920 --> 00:13:08,960
Mokku, I invited him without telling you.

149
00:13:13,169 --> 00:13:16,480
Grandfather, thank you for coming. Please, come in.

150
00:13:23,429 --> 00:13:25,040
They insisted, you see.

151
00:13:45,709 --> 00:13:47,840
This is delicious. Truly delicious.

152
00:13:48,620 --> 00:13:49,980
Just chew it...

153
00:13:57,425 --> 00:13:58,425
(Grandpa sobbing)

154
00:13:58,740 --> 00:14:00,760
Grandpa, please just go home!

155
00:14:01,780 --> 00:14:02,780
Huh?

156
00:14:03,439 --> 00:14:05,880
I wish you had never come!

157
00:14:06,655 --> 00:14:07,700
Mokku...

158
00:14:08,099 --> 00:14:09,880
What is the matter, Mokku?

159
00:14:10,735 --> 00:14:15,620
Grandpa has always been poor, so he doesn't belong with high-class people!

160
00:14:16,889 --> 00:14:19,340
I understand. Grandpa will go home.

161
00:14:26,040 --> 00:14:27,040
(Laughter)

162
00:14:34,599 --> 00:14:35,900
Stop it, Mokku.

163
00:14:36,065 --> 00:14:37,620
Mokku, you shouldn't.

164
00:14:38,360 --> 00:14:41,420
It's fine. It's better than being made fun of.

165
00:14:47,509 --> 00:14:49,600
Mellerie, let's dance.

166
00:14:50,380 --> 00:14:51,380
Huh?

167
00:14:52,479 --> 00:14:56,300
After dinner, of course. After all, I'm a gentleman.

168
00:15:20,580 --> 00:15:26,920
[(NO AUDIO)]

169
00:15:41,509 --> 00:15:44,820
Mokku? Will you stay here forever?

170
00:15:45,920 --> 00:15:46,920
Yeah.

171
00:15:53,940 --> 00:15:57,720
When I grow up, I want to be your wife.

172
00:15:58,540 --> 00:15:59,540
Really?

173
00:16:00,899 --> 00:16:03,600
Really. You can kiss me.

174
00:16:06,999 --> 00:16:10,760
We can't. We're still just kids.

175
00:16:11,355 --> 00:16:13,980
But we're going to get married when we grow up, right?

176
00:16:14,260 --> 00:16:15,580
Well, yeah, but...

177
00:16:21,389 --> 00:16:27,700
Wearing gloves and acting fancy... There's no way a wooden puppet can grow up, let alone get married.

178
00:16:28,120 --> 00:16:31,680
Why don't you tell her the truth? Mokku, what's wrong?

179
00:16:31,855 --> 00:16:33,120
It's nothing.

180
00:16:33,845 --> 00:16:36,980
You can't keep hiding it forever. What are you going to do?

181
00:16:57,520 --> 00:17:00,640
When I grow up, I'm going to be Mokku's bride.

182
00:17:06,979 --> 00:17:09,720
But I'm a wooden puppet.

183
00:17:13,509 --> 00:17:15,280
I can't marry Mellerie.

184
00:17:29,100 --> 00:17:31,560
[[NO AUDIO]]

185
00:17:38,749 --> 00:17:40,440
Ah, the Oak Tree Fairy!

186
00:17:40,900 --> 00:17:42,300
[[NO AUDIO]]

187
00:17:44,019 --> 00:17:46,940
Mokku, tell Mellerie the truth.

188
00:17:47,389 --> 00:17:50,600
Otherwise, you will only make yourself miserable.

189
00:17:51,800 --> 00:17:57,480
I did tell her! / You must never lie to someone you love.

190
00:17:58,499 --> 00:18:02,460
I don't love her! I just kind of like her!

191
00:18:03,734 --> 00:18:11,180
Because Grandfather bought you clothes, he had no money left for an inn and is working on a farm.

192
00:18:12,599 --> 00:18:17,960
Yet you sleep in such a soft bed without a care in the world?

193
00:18:19,119 --> 00:18:23,960
But Grandpa hates rich people, so he left on his own.

194
00:18:28,179 --> 00:18:30,420
Mokku, how long are you going to keep lying?

195
00:18:31,044 --> 00:18:35,180
All right! I won't lie anymore, so please turn my nose back to normal!

196
00:18:36,504 --> 00:18:40,000
With such an embarrassing nose, he can't go see Mellerie.

197
00:18:41,180 --> 00:18:46,380
If you do not have the courage to tell the truth, then it is not true love.

198
00:18:47,569 --> 00:18:48,680
Do you understand, Mokku?

199
00:18:51,649 --> 00:19:00,380
Mokku, what you must do is become a real human with a kind and righteous heart.

200
00:19:02,719 --> 00:19:05,920
I understand. I'll tell the truth.

201
00:19:08,969 --> 00:19:12,380
Goodbye, Mokku. Be brave.

202
00:19:26,469 --> 00:19:27,880
Mokku, what's wrong?

203
00:19:29,099 --> 00:19:31,220
Uh, it's nothing.

204
00:19:31,540 --> 00:19:32,540
Really?

205
00:19:33,720 --> 00:19:34,720
Mellerie!

206
00:19:36,659 --> 00:19:38,800
I'm going to go check on Grandpa!

207
00:19:40,439 --> 00:19:41,800
Mokku...

208
00:19:50,129 --> 00:19:54,400
I can't! I can't say it! I just don't have the courage!

209
00:19:55,279 --> 00:19:56,500
Help!

210
00:19:56,579 --> 00:19:57,900
Help us!

211
00:19:59,534 --> 00:20:01,280
Look, it went that way!

212
00:20:01,580 --> 00:20:02,020
All right!

213
00:20:02,339 --> 00:20:03,980
Wooden puppet, save us!

214
00:20:04,459 --> 00:20:05,720
Oh, butterflies!

215
00:20:05,979 --> 00:20:07,380
They'll turn us into specimens!

216
00:20:08,160 --> 00:20:09,160
Quick, go!

217
00:20:09,440 --> 00:20:10,440
All right!

218
00:20:12,099 --> 00:20:14,080
You're safe now.

219
00:20:15,709 --> 00:20:16,709
Hurry and get away!

220
00:20:17,549 --> 00:20:18,840
Hey! What are you doing?!

221
00:20:19,459 --> 00:20:20,460
Be careful!

222
00:20:21,420 --> 00:20:21,960
Why, you...!

223
00:20:22,440 --> 00:20:22,880
Ah!

224
00:20:22,960 --> 00:20:24,620
Ow, ow, ow! That hurts!

225
00:20:24,621 --> 00:20:25,660
What?

226
00:20:26,899 --> 00:20:30,060
You damn little brat...!

227
00:20:32,620 --> 00:20:33,620
You?

228
00:20:34,419 --> 00:20:38,440
Of course! My body is made of oak!

229
00:20:38,441 --> 00:20:40,320
Damn it! You monster! Get him, everyone!

230
00:20:40,321 --> 00:20:40,700
Take this!

231
00:20:40,701 --> 00:20:43,420
Take that!

232
00:20:44,149 --> 00:20:46,860
How dare you insult Grandpa and me last night!

233
00:20:48,680 --> 00:20:49,940
Mokku! Stop it!

234
00:20:58,040 --> 00:20:59,040
[(NO AUDIO)]

235
00:21:10,299 --> 00:21:18,520
Mokku... You're... Wait! I... I have to say it myself.

236
00:21:22,459 --> 00:21:28,900
I'm a wooden puppet made from an oak tree.

237
00:21:50,139 --> 00:21:52,620
Mellerie, this is who I really am.

238
00:21:56,229 --> 00:21:58,000
Mellerie...

239
00:22:01,529 --> 00:22:04,940
I'm not mature enough to love you yet.

240
00:22:05,979 --> 00:22:09,280
I have to work hard to become a real human.

241
00:22:10,864 --> 00:22:13,540
Thank you, Mellerie. Goodbye.

242
00:22:21,419 --> 00:22:27,280
He'll come back to see you again.

243
00:22:28,829 --> 00:22:30,000
Mokku...

244
00:22:30,799 --> 00:22:32,080
Mokku!

245
00:22:58,220 --> 00:22:58,660
(Grandfather's face)

246
00:22:59,219 --> 00:23:07,220
Cheer up, Mokku. You've learned an important lesson that school could never teach you. Come on, let's go.

247
00:23:07,720 --> 00:23:08,720
Yes.

248
00:23:12,239 --> 00:23:13,380
Grandfather!

249
00:23:16,040 --> 00:23:16,940
Mokku!

250
00:23:16,984 --> 00:23:19,860
Now, wait! It's dangerous to run so fast!

251
00:23:33,259 --> 00:23:36,940
One day, adults who came into the village plotted to make money, and...

252
00:23:37,500 --> 00:23:45,500
They plan to build a huge amusement park in the forest, and chop down the Oak Tree where the Fairy who gave Mokku life lives.

253
00:23:45,799 --> 00:23:50,160
To protect the Fairy and the peaceful lives of the crows and squirrels, Mokku takes a stand.

254
00:23:52,300 --> 00:24:00,300
Can Mokku save the Oak Tree from the sharp axe about to fall? Find out next week on Kashi no Ki Mokku!

